# AI Workspace Changelog

Audit history for this repo's AI/agent configuration (constitution, rules,
skills, agents, commands, hooks, settings). Maintained by the
`ai-engineering-workspace-audit` skill — one entry per run, newest first.
This file is the record that stops future audits from re-litigating settled
decisions: the "deliberately NOT changed" list is as load-bearing as the
changes themselves.

Entry format — copy per run:

## <YYYY-MM-DD> — <quick|full> audit

**Mode:** <quick|full>. **Baseline:** `<branch@short-sha>`. **Branch:** `<working branch>`.

### Headline result

<One or two sentences: the most important outcome, with numbers where possible
(e.g. always-loaded lines before → after).>

### Changes applied

| # | Commit | Change | Ladder rung | Ledger items |
|---|---|---|---|---|

### Deliberately NOT changed (with reasons)

- <artifact / finding> — <why it was left alone>

### Follow-ups

- <anything outside audit scope that needs a ticket or a later run>
